# ==============================================================================
# P2R Web Portal - Environment Reference (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
#
# Authoritative production origin:
#   https://pameran.devsaka.id
#
# Routing contract:
#   /       public web (this application)
#   /panel  admin panel (p2r-panel)
#   /api    public API (Caddy rewrites /api/* to Laravel /p2r/v1/*)
#
# Browser API requests use the same-origin relative path `/api` by default,
# so the same built artifact works across all hostnames without rebuilding.
#
# Server-side API requests (SSR / ISR) require `P2R_API_BASE_URL` at RUNTIME
# to reach the Laravel API directly on the private network.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Browser API base (Optional override; defaults to /api)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Defaults to same-origin `/api` when left empty.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_P2R_API_BASE_URL=/api

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Server-side API base (RUNTIME only, server components & ISR)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Read at runtime by lib/api/config.ts on the Node server.
# Production default (FrankenPHP on same host):
P2R_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8090/p2r/v1

# Staging / Validation default:
# P2R_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8091/p2r/v1
